# ── Added 2026-08-11 after measuring the build context at 123.3 MB ───────────
# tsconfig.tsbuildinfo is regenerated by every local `tsc` run, so it changed
# on every build and invalidated the `COPY . .` layer gratuitously.
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

